# SDSD Repository-as-Context Rules (.cursorrules)
# Version: 2.1.0
# Domain: AetherFi Distributed Financial Core

# ==============================================================================
# ABSOLUTE ARCHITECTURAL INVARIANTS (NEVER VIOLATE)
# ==============================================================================
# 1. TENANT ISOLATION: All database queries and cache keys MUST be scoped by tenant_id.
# 2. CONSERVATION OF MASS: sum(debits) MUST exactly equal sum(credits) in any ledger mutation.
# 3. ZERO RAW SQL: All SQL statements must use parameterized ORM queries. Raw f-strings are forbidden.
# 4. CRYPTO INTEGRITY: Never use MD5 or SHA-1 for security. Use bcrypt for passwords and SHA-256 for cache keys.

# ==============================================================================
# BLAST RADIUS BOUNDARIES
# ==============================================================================
# - You may only modify files in the active task subpackage.
# - NEVER modify src/core/auth/, src/db/migrations/, or .github/ without explicit spec authorization.

# ==============================================================================
# POSITIVE CODING DIRECTIVES
# ==============================================================================
# - Database sessions: Use AsyncSession with 'select()' constructs.
# - Input validation: Use strict Pydantic v2 schemas with extra="forbid".
# - Currency arithmetic: Use decimal.Decimal with ROUND_HALF_EVEN.
